WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.170
You buy the bottom, and it breaks again? Pros wait for one sign.

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:10.550
Change of Character: the first break against the trend.

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:15.950
Step one: mark the last lower high.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.350
Step two: a candle closes above it. That's the CHoCH.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:26.100
Step three: don't buy right away. Wait for a higher low.

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:30.070
Common mistake: mixing up CHoCH and BOS.

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:34.920
I show setups like this live in my free group. Comment GOLD.
